.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH gpuq-check-config 1  "gpuq 0.3.0" 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH NAME
gpuq\-check\-config \- Load and validate the config, then exit
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgpuq check config\fR [\fB\-\-api\fR] [\fB\-c\fR|\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-strict\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH DESCRIPTION
Load and validate the config, then exit
.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-api\fR \fI<HOST:PORT>\fR
Address of the gpuq control API (default: $GPUQ_API, else 127.0.0.1:9390)
.TP
\fB\-c\fR, \fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Config file (default: search the usual places)
.TP
\fB\-\-strict\fR
Also fail when the VRAM probe does not work
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgpuq\fR(1)
